sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operador (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-permission-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-permission-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CTRL as Controller (ipm-permission-controller)
  participant ZIT as Zitadel (ProjectService)

  Note over U,API: 1. Atualização com PATCH
  U->>API: PATCH /v1/ipm/permissions/{id} (Header: If-Match ou corpo: resourceVersion)
  API->>API: valida permissão ipm.permission.admin
  alt resourceVersion divergente
    API-->>U: 409 Conflict (OptimisticLockFailed)
  else sucesso na validação
    API->>DB: Transação SQL: UPDATE ipm.permission (phase Reconciling, gen++), INSERT outbox
    API-->>U: 200 OK (Resource atualizado)
    P->>DB: drena outbox
    P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.permission.<id>
    NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired
    CTRL->>ZIT: UpdateProjectRole(...)
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE ipm.permission SET phase = Ready, observed_generation = generation
  end

  Note over U,API: 2. Exclusão com DELETE
  U->>API: DELETE /v1/ipm/permissions/{id}?resourceVersion=N
  API->>API: valida permissão ipm.permission.admin
  alt deletionProtection == true
    API-->>U: 409 Conflict (DeletionProtected)
  else sucesso na validação
    API->>DB: Transação SQL: UPDATE ipm.permission SET lifecycle = absent, phase = Deleting, INSERT outbox
    API-->>U: 202 Accepted (Resource em Deleting)
    P->>DB: drena outbox
    P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.permission.<id>
    NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired
    CTRL->>ZIT: RemoveProjectRole(key)
    CTRL->>DB: DELETE FROM ipm.permission WHERE resource_id = id
  end
